      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 3.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "good afternoon how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.0,
      "end_seconds": 6.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "what's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.61,
      "end_seconds": 12.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "so, I've been feeling weak, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.16,
      "end_seconds": 14.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.68,
      "end_seconds": 35.8,
      "duration_seconds": 20.12,
      "text": "it's been like this since yesterday my family kept telling me to get it checked i just want to get back to normal, really i did have nearly blacking out at one point, but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.36,
      "end_seconds": 43.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any black stools, chest pain or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.98,
      "end_seconds": 48.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "no, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.64,
      "end_seconds": 51.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "understood. Any sign of fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.21,
      "end_seconds": 57.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No. No fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.92,
      "end_seconds": 60.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.37,
      "end_seconds": 64.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Well no my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.99,
      "end_seconds": 67.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "how are your bowels any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.36,
      "end_seconds": 72.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.86,
      "end_seconds": 92.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.44,
      "end_seconds": 97.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Let me think, no, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.96,
      "end_seconds": 105.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.95,
      "end_seconds": 110.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I'm allergic to amoxicillin, I get hives"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.47,
      "end_seconds": 113.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.49,
      "end_seconds": 117.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.79,
      "end_seconds": 124.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.68,
      "end_seconds": 127.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "my grandmother had dementia"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.83,
      "end_seconds": 142.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.87,
      "end_seconds": 148.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.79,
      "end_seconds": 152.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "So are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.3,
      "end_seconds": 157.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.32,
      "end_seconds": 160.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.51,
      "end_seconds": 184.12,
      "duration_seconds": 17.61,
      "text": "let me think, you know, I had a cataract operation in my left eye about a year ago i didn't wanna make a fuss, you know i've never really been one for hospitals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.65,
      "end_seconds": 188.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.93,
      "end_seconds": 198.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.33,
      "end_seconds": 224.44,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "okay: BMI works out to 22.3, blood pressure 98 over 65. And weight 53 kilos, temperature is 37.0 degrees, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, heart rate 95, height 154 centimetres"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.46,
      "end_seconds": 228.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.15,
      "end_seconds": 233.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.9,
      "end_seconds": 240.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "let me look at the the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.89,
      "end_seconds": 254.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "okay, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.33,
      "end_seconds": 257.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "does that that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.91,
      "end_seconds": 273.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Your blood pressure drops when you stand, from the lying reading to standing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.37,
      "end_seconds": 295.9,
      "duration_seconds": 19.53,
      "text": "that's the examination finished from what you've told me and what I found, I'm honestly not certain yet it could be postural low blood pressure, possibly related to medicines or dehydration, or it might be dehydration i want an ECG done, that's for dizziness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.73,
      "end_seconds": 299.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.37,
      "end_seconds": 308.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "get up slowly from lying and sitting and keep drinking fluids through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.92,
      "end_seconds": 314.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Should I have a lying and standing blood pressure check as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.56,
      "end_seconds": 330.27,
      "duration_seconds": 13.71,
      "text": "I don't think that's needed at this stage the history doesn't call for it let's review you after the results are back okay does all of that that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.28,
      "end_seconds": 334.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "So, alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
